L["The Gamepad UI is on: /reload so OpenMap leaves the world map to Blizzard (until then the game may block closing the map with the controller)."] = "遊戲控制器使用者介面已開啟：請輸入 /reload，讓 OpenMap 將世界地圖交還給 Blizzard（在此之前，遊戲可能會阻擋用控制器關閉地圖）。"
L["The OpenMap button and your favourites on the map. Off, the menu opens with /openmap, the minimap button or the minimap's AddOns list."] = "地圖上的 OpenMap 按鈕與你的收藏。關閉時，可用 /openmap、小地圖按鈕或小地圖的插件列表開啟選單。"
L["The OpenMap button is hidden. Its menu opens with /openmap, the minimap button or the minimap's AddOns list."] = "OpenMap 按鈕已隱藏。可用 /openmap、小地圖按鈕或小地圖的插件列表開啟選單。"
L["The first installed"] = "第一個已安裝的"
L["The frame rate at most while the map is open (0: off). A big map draws many layers over the whole screen every frame; 60 halves the graphics card's work at 120 fps, for a smooth enough map. The game's own frame rate setting comes back as the map closes."] = "地圖開啟時的最高 FPS（0：關閉）。大型地圖每一幀都要在整個畫面上繪製許多圖層；在 120 FPS 下設為 60 可讓顯示卡的工作量減半，地圖仍夠流暢。地圖關閉時會恢復遊戲本身的 FPS 設定。"
L["The game lists no bosses for it."] = "遊戲中沒有列出此處的首領。"
L["The map"] = "地圖"
L["The map is off."] = "地圖已停用。"
L["The minimap's detail over the six major cities' own maps, at half strength at most so the city's plan leads. Off: their own maps alone."] = "六座主城自帶地圖上的小地圖細節，最多為一半強度，讓城市平面圖為主。關閉：只顯示主城自己的地圖。"
L["The most the minimap's detail ever shows, at any zoom."] = "在任何縮放下，小地圖細節顯示的最大程度。"
L["The most the minimap's detail ever shows, at any zoom: zooming in past where the painted map has any detail left, it takes over toward this."] = "在任何縮放下，小地圖細節顯示的最大程度：放大超過手繪地圖已無細節的程度時，小地圖會逐漸接手，直到此值。"
L["The quest log can't be opened or closed in combat."] = "戰鬥中無法開啟或關閉任務日誌。"
L["The quests in your log on the map from every zone and at any zoom. Blizzard's map shows a zone's quests only once you've zoomed in on that zone."] = "在地圖上顯示任務日誌中所有區域的任務，任何縮放程度皆可見。Blizzard 的地圖只有在你放大到某個區域後，才會顯示該區域的任務。"
L["The quill draws on the world, continent and zone maps."] = "鵝毛筆可在世界、大陸與區域地圖上繪製。"
L["The stars in the OpenMap menu put buttons here; Shift-right-click one to take it off."] = "在 OpenMap 選單中點星號，即可把按鈕放到這裡；SHIFT+右鍵點擊按鈕即可移除。"
L["The zoom (in times the whole-world view) the map's icons for places show from: dungeons, boats, zeppelins and flight masters (1: from the whole world; higher: only further in). 0 is Auto: each from its own zoom, as it comes. Townsfolk never show further out than their own; your pins, drawings and party always show."] = "地點圖示開始顯示的縮放（以整個世界視野的倍數計）：地城、船、飛艇與飛行管理員（1：從整個世界視野就顯示；更高：只在放得更大時顯示）。0 為自動：各圖示依其預設的縮放顯示。村民不會在比其自身設定更小的縮放下顯示；你的地圖標記、繪圖與隊伍則一律顯示。"
L["The zoom the icons for places show from: dungeons, boats, zeppelins and flight masters. 1x: from the whole world; higher: only further in. Auto: each from its own zoom. Townsfolk never show further out than their own; your pins, drawings and party always show."] = "地點圖示開始顯示的縮放：地城、船、飛艇與飛行管理員。1x：從整個世界視野就顯示；更高：只在放得更大時顯示。自動：各依其預設的縮放。村民不會在比其自身設定更小的縮放下顯示；你的地圖標記、繪圖與隊伍則一律顯示。"
L["They're also saved in WTF\\Account\\<account>\\SavedVariables\\OpenMap.lua once you /reload or log out."] = "在你 /reload 或登出後，也會儲存到 WTF\\Account\\<帳號>\\SavedVariables\\OpenMap.lua。"
