L["Unreleased"] = "未發布"
L["Up close"] = "近距離"
L["Upcoming"] = "即將推出"
L["Updated to %s: see What's new in the OpenMap menu."] = "已更新至 %s：請見 OpenMap 選單中的「更新內容」。"
L["Vendors"] = "商人"
L["Versions: |cffffffff%d|r"] = "版本：|cffffffff%d|r"
L["Waypoint"] = "路徑點"
L["What the next note is: paint its area (or click) and say what's there."] = "下一則註記的類型：塗出其區域（或點擊）並說明那裡有什麼。"
L["What you've drawn with the quill (the OpenMap menu's Quill), on the map."] = "你用鵝毛筆（OpenMap 選單中的「鵝毛筆」）在地圖上畫的內容。"
L["What's new"] = "更新內容"
L["What's new in OpenMap"] = "OpenMap 更新內容"
L["When maximized, the map takes the screen's whole width instead of keeping Blizzard's shape with bars at the sides."] = "最大化時，地圖佔滿整個螢幕寬度，而不是維持 Blizzard 原本的比例並在兩側留邊。"
L["When reopening the map"] = "重新開啟地圖時"
L["Where the Quests tab's quests come from, when you have more than one of these addons. The first installed: Questie, then Dungeon Journal, then NeedRoll."] = "當你安裝了不只一個這類插件時，「任務」分頁的任務來源。第一個已安裝的：依序為 Questie、Dungeon Journal、NeedRoll。"
L["Where you are isn't on the world map here."] = "你所在的位置不在此處的世界地圖上。"
L["Whispered to your target (if they have OpenMap, they're asked whether to add it)."] = "以悄悄話傳給你的目標（若對方有 OpenMap，會詢問是否加入）。"
L["White"] = "白色"
L["Width"] = "粗細"
L["With Dungeon Journal installed, an entrance can open that dungeon's page in it instead of its map (its map still opens where Dungeon Journal has no page for it)."] = "安裝 Dungeon Journal 後，點擊入口可改為開啟該地城在其中的頁面，而不是地城地圖（若 Dungeon Journal 沒有該地城的頁面，仍會開啟地圖）。"
L["With Questie, Dungeon Journal or NeedRoll, this dungeon's quests are here."] = "安裝 Questie、Dungeon Journal 或 NeedRoll 後，此地城的任務會顯示在這裡。"
L["With a gamepad, that map opens once you're out of combat."] = "使用控制器時，該地圖會在你脫離戰鬥後開啟。"
L["With the game's Gamepad UI on, OpenMap's map instead of Blizzard's. The controller's B and full-screen buttons on the map are OpenMap's then, so the game doesn't block them. Still being tried out: if the game blocks something, turn this off and /reload."] = "遊戲控制器使用者介面開啟時，使用 OpenMap 的地圖取代 Blizzard 的地圖。此時地圖上控制器的 B 鍵與全螢幕鍵由 OpenMap 接管，遊戲不會阻擋。仍在測試中：若遊戲阻擋了某些動作，請關閉此選項並輸入 /reload。"
L["WoW Forever has no map of this dungeon yet."] = "WoW Forever 尚無此地城的地圖。"
L["World map: Blizzard's map isn't the expected kind; the seamless map is off."] = "世界地圖：Blizzard 的地圖不是預期的類型；無縫地圖已關閉。"
L["World map: Blizzard's map layers aren't the expected ones; the stitched art may cover some map icons."] = "世界地圖：Blizzard 的地圖圖層與預期不符；拼接的地圖圖片可能會遮住部分地圖圖示。"
L["World map: townsfolk and rare mobs come from Questie's database. Install and enable Questie to see them."] = "世界地圖：村民和稀有生物來自 Questie 的資料庫。安裝並啟用 Questie 即可看到它們。"
L["World map: townsfolk and rares need Questie's database, which isn't available."] = "世界地圖：村民與稀有生物需要 Questie 的資料庫，但目前無法使用。"
L["You aren't on the world map here (an instance or a place it doesn't cover)."] = "你目前的位置不在世界地圖上（在副本中，或地圖未涵蓋的地方）。"
L["You can change any of it later in OpenMap's menu (its button on the map, or /openmap)."] = "之後都可以在 OpenMap 選單中更改（地圖上的按鈕，或 /openmap）。"
L["Your arrow"] = "你的箭頭"
L["Your buttons"] = "你的按鈕"
L["Your drawings"] = "你的繪圖"
L["Your guild (those with OpenMap are asked whether to add it)."] = "你的公會（有 OpenMap 的人會被詢問是否加入）。"
L["Your own arrow on the world map. Off, you find your way old-school, by the land around you; your party still shows, and so does the minimap."] = "你在世界地圖上的箭頭。關閉時，你得用老派的方式靠周圍地形認路；隊友仍會顯示，小地圖也一樣。"
L["Your party or raid (those with OpenMap are asked whether to add it)."] = "你的隊伍或團隊（有 OpenMap 的人會被詢問是否加入）。"
L["Zeppelin"] = "飛艇"
L["Zeppelin towers (click one: the other end), and zeppelins' routes when routes are shown."] = "飛艇塔（點擊：前往另一端），並在顯示航線時顯示飛艇航線。"
L["Zeppelins"] = "飛艇"
L["Zone"] = "區域"
L["Zone highlight on hover"] = "游標停留時醒目顯示區域"
L["Zone levels"] = "區域等級"
L["Zoom right in on a cave, mine or crypt, or a dungeon's entrance area, and its map surfaces from underground: Blizzard's own where it drew one, else the game's minimap of it. Over one, the zoom goes on past the deepest zoom."] = "放大到洞穴、礦坑、墓穴或地城入口區域時，其地圖會從地下浮現：有 Blizzard 繪製的地圖就用它，否則用遊戲的小地圖。在其上方可放大到超過最大縮放。"
L["Zoomed right out, the world map lies on an ocean that fills the window, in a border: the sea, compass roses, sea creatures, ships and the frame round it painted by Santiago Reyes (used with his permission), laid out for the window's shape, wide or tall. The game's own map stays in the middle. Off: no border."] = "縮到最遠時，世界地圖會鋪在一片填滿視窗的海洋上，四周圍著邊框：海洋、羅盤、海怪、船隻與邊框由 Santiago Reyes 繪製（經其同意使用），並依視窗的形狀排列，無論寬窄。遊戲本身的地圖仍在中間。關閉：沒有邊框。"
